# The published Martini 3 set and the reference corpus are upstream inputs, not source: every run records
# their sha256 in `inputs/inputs.json`, and a run reads the installed set in place. They stay on disk,
# never in git -- provision them into a checkout (see docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md).
